    "Fill content": ["Füllinhalt","Contenu du remplissage","Contenido del relleno","Contenuto del riempimento"],
    "Flesh (mottled + veins)": ["Fleisch (gesprenkelt + Adern)","Chair (marbrée + veines)","Carne (moteada + venas)","Carne (screziata + vene)"],
