    "Full-screen overlays for in-game cameras: camcorder and found-footage horror, bodycams, security monitors, drones, photo modes and helmet cams.": ["Vollbild-Overlays für Ingame-Kameras: Camcorder- und Found-Footage-Horror, Bodycams, Überwachungsmonitore, Drohnen, Fotomodi und Helmkameras.","Overlays plein écran pour caméras en jeu : caméscope et horreur found footage, bodycams, moniteurs de surveillance, drones, modes photo et caméras de casque.","Overlays a pantalla completa para cámaras en el juego: videocámara y terror found footage, bodycams, monitores de seguridad, drones, modos foto y cámaras de casco.","Overlay a schermo intero per telecamere in-game: videocamera e horror found footage, bodycam, monitor di sorveglianza, droni, modalità foto e telecamere da casco."],
